<title>GERMANY: German March steel output up 4.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German March steel output up 4.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office gave the following data on pan-German steel production (in millions of tonnes):</p>
<p>		  March	Pct change</p>
<p>Pig iron	 2.54	 +4.7</p>
<p>Crude steel    3.75	 +4.3</p>
<p>		 Jan-Mar     Pct Change</p>
<p>Pig iron	 7.32	 +8.5</p>
<p>Crude steel   10.55	 +8.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage changes are against year-earlier figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
